///1HOST
Help by Willem Aandewiel
HOST - Installation-specific program

///2STATUS
HOST.COM is not a standard Digital Research CP/M 2.2 command.
Its behavior depends on the computer, emulator or distribution.
Its name does not establish which host functions it provides
or how to invoke them.

///2ORIGIN
Check your installation's documentation and WELCOME.TXT:

  A>TYPE WELCOME.TXT

Use parameters only after identifying the version and its syntax.
Options from a different HOST program may not apply.

///2DETAILS
The specific HOST.COM binary has not been supplied or identified.
This page explicitly records that missing information.
